#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "On Wayland, switching and arranging windows, pasting, clipboard history, screenshots and the hold-to-talk key go through a small GNOME Shell extension that only Heyo can use."
msgstr "在 Wayland 上，切换和排列窗口、粘贴、剪贴板历史、截图以及按住说话键，都要通过一个仅供 Heyo 使用的小型 GNOME Shell 扩展来完成。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "This version of Heyo comes with a newer extension than the one installed. Update it, then log out and back in. An extension that is already running keeps working until then, without what the new one adds."
msgstr "此版本的 Heyo 附带的扩展比已安装的更新。请更新，然后注销并重新登录。在此之前，正在运行的扩展仍可继续使用，只是没有新版增加的功能。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "In place. Log out and back in to finish: GNOME loads a new or updated extension only when a session starts."
msgstr "已就绪。请注销并重新登录以完成：GNOME 只在会话开始时加载新安装或更新的扩展。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "GNOME Shell Extension"
msgstr "GNOME Shell 扩展"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Heyo Hotkey"
msgstr "Heyo 快捷键"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Open at Login"
msgstr "登录时打开"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Bind a desktop keyboard shortcut to heyo."
msgstr "请在桌面的键盘快捷键设置中为 heyo 绑定一个快捷键。"

