msgstr "语言"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "What Heyo itself says. Extensions speak their own."
msgstr "Heyo 自身界面的语言。扩展使用各自的语言。"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Window"
msgstr "窗口"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Compact Mode"
msgstr "紧凑模式"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Show only the search field until you type"
msgstr "输入之前只显示搜索框"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Hide When Focus Is Lost"
msgstr "失去焦点时隐藏"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Close the window when you click elsewhere"
msgstr "点击其他位置时关闭窗口"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Keep the Running Command"
msgstr "保留正在运行的命令"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Reopening Heyo returns to the command you were using instead of the root search"
msgstr "再次打开 Heyo 时回到上次使用的命令，而不是主搜索"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Live Activities"
msgstr "实时活动"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Show What Is in Progress"
msgstr "显示进行中的事项"

#: src-tauri/src/slint_windows/model.rs
msgid "Timers, downloads and what extensions report as under way, at the top of the root search, with a notification when one ends or needs you"
msgstr "计时器、下载以及扩展报告的进行中事项会显示在主搜索顶部，结束或需要你处理时会发出通知"

